  "This prototype does not persist an audit record. A submitted navigation decision would record the actor and outcome without field content.": "此原型不会持久保存审计记录。提交后的导航决定会记录操作人和结果，但不记录字段内容。",
  "This prototype refresh restores the simulated processing state; no durable remote operation is queried.": "此原型刷新会恢复模拟的处理中状态；不会查询持久化远程操作。",
  "This records reconciliation intent only. It does not assert target success, change a formal identity, or redispatch the operation.": "这仅记录对账意图。它不会断言目标成功、更改正式标识或重新分派操作。",
  "This request reached a final failure. Correct the source data and prepare a new execution request.": "此请求已进入最终失败。请更正源数据并准备新的执行请求。",
  "This review records an NPI One proposal only. It does not create ERP quality, customer signature, Gate, readiness or Tooling lifecycle truth.": "此审查仅记录 NPI One 提案，不会创建企业资源计划系统质量、客户签署、阶段门、就绪度或模具生命周期事实。",
  "This review surface sends no production request and changes no saved settings.": "此审查界面不会发送生产请求，也不会更改任何已保存设置。",
